      "item": "H3F3A G34R",
      "evidence_id": "e8",
      "quote": "Recent studies on high-grade pediatric GBM have identified two recurrent mutations (K27M and G34R/V) in genes encoding histone H3 (H3F3A for H3.3 and HIST1H3B for H3.1)"
